Title: DSW QA Test Package That Forces a System IQ Mismatch
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("DSW", "QA", email = "noreply@sycamoreinformatics.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Test-only package. Requires getopt >= 1.20.4 so installing it
    upgrades a lock-pinned getopt 1.20.3 and System IQ reports a mismatch.
